  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1789016363
      nanos: 243823851
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "# Build a Modern Event Decoration Product Showcase Website\n\nCreate a **production-quality, fully responsive product listing website** for an event management and stage decoration company called **\342\200\234Event Perambra\342\200\235**.\n\nThe website should showcase event decoration packages and services as **visual products**, but **do not display prices**. The primary goal is to inspire customers, help them explore decoration options, view detailed photos/features, and contact the company directly through WhatsApp.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Technology Stack\n\nUse:\n\n* **React.js**\n* **Tailwind CSS**\n* **Framer Motion** for animations\n* React Router for navigation\n* Modern component-based architecture\n* Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop\n* Clean, reusable components\n* Optimized image loading\n* Semantic HTML and good accessibility practices\n\nDo NOT create a generic template-looking website.\n\nThe design should feel like a **real premium event decoration brand website**.\n\n---\n\n# 2. Brand\n\n### Company Name\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n### Business Type\n\nEvent management and stage decoration company.\n\nThe website primarily showcases:\n\n* Wedding stage decorations\n* Engagement decorations\n* Birthday decorations\n* Reception decorations\n* Haldi decorations\n* Mehndi decorations\n* Anniversary decorations\n* Baby shower decorations\n* Traditional Kerala-style decorations\n* Modern stage setups\n* Floral decorations\n* Backdrop decorations\n* Entrance decorations\n* Customized event setups\n\nUse realistic product/service terminology rather than generic e-commerce terminology wherever appropriate.\n\nFor example, instead of:\n\n> \342\200\234Product 01\342\200\235\n\nUse attractive names such as:\n\n> **Royal Floral Wedding Stage**\n\n> **Elegant Ivory Reception Setup**\n\n> **Dream Garden Engagement Stage**\n\n> **Kerala Heritage Wedding Decor**\n\n> **Luxury Golden Glow Stage**\n\n---\n\n# 3. Overall Design Direction\n\nCreate a **simple, elegant, premium and visually attractive UI**.\n\nThe website should feel like a combination of:\n\n* Premium event portfolio\n* Modern product catalog\n* Wedding inspiration platform\n* Mobile-first business website\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Overly complicated layouts\n* Excessive gradients\n* Cheap-looking colors\n* Generic dashboard-style UI\n* Generic SaaS templates\n* Excessive animations\n* Huge blocks of text\n* Price-focused e-commerce design\n\nThe **photography should be the main focus**.\n\nUse generous whitespace, elegant typography, rounded cards, subtle shadows, beautiful image layouts and refined animations.\n\nSuggested visual direction:\n\n* Warm neutral background\n* White / off-white surfaces\n* Elegant dark typography\n* Subtle gold/beige accent\n* Large high-quality event photography\n* Soft rounded corners\n* Minimal borders\n* Premium editorial-style layouts\n\nDo not overuse gold. Keep the design sophisticated.\n\n---\n\n# 4. Home Page\n\nCreate a visually strong homepage.\n\n## Hero Section\n\nLarge, immersive event decoration image/video background.\n\nHeadline should be emotionally appealing and customer-focused.\n\nExample:\n\n> **\342\200\234Turning Your Special Moments Into Beautiful Memories.\342\200\235**\n\nSupporting text:\n\n> **\342\200\234Elegant stage decorations and unforgettable event setups, thoughtfully designed for your special day.\342\200\235**\n\nPrimary CTA:\n\n**Explore Decorations**\n\nSecondary CTA:\n\n**Chat on WhatsApp**\n\nInclude a subtle animated scroll indicator.\n\nUse Framer Motion for:\n\n* Text entrance\n* Image reveal\n* CTA animation\n* Subtle floating effects\n\nDo not make animations distracting.\n\n---\n\n# 5. Customer-Centric Copy\n\nUse attractive words that appeal to customers.\n\nAvoid boring generic copy such as:\n\n> \342\200\234We provide event management services.\342\200\235\n\nInstead use messaging like:\n\n> **\342\200\234Your dream celebration deserves a beautiful stage.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234Designed around your moment. Decorated around your vision.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234From intimate celebrations to grand weddings, we create spaces worth remembering.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234Choose your style. Share your vision. Let us create the setting.\342\200\235**\n\nThe copy should communicate:\n\n* Emotion\n* Elegance\n* Trust\n* Creativity\n* Customization\n* Memorable experiences\n\n---\n\n# 6. Decoration Categories\n\nCreate a beautiful category navigation section.\n\nCategories could include:\n\n* Weddings\n* Engagements\n* Birthdays\n* Receptions\n* Haldi\n* Mehndi\n* Baby Shower\n* Traditional\n* Modern\n* Floral\n* Custom Designs\n\nEach category should have an attractive image and subtle hover animation.\n\nOn mobile, categories should work like a horizontally scrollable app-style category selector.\n\n---\n\n# 7. Product / Decoration Listing\n\nCreate the main **Decoration Collection** section.\n\nEach decoration should be presented as a product-style card.\n\nExample card:\n\n### Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\n\nLarge image.\n\nSmall category label:\n\n**Wedding Stage**\n\nShort description:\n\n> A luxurious floral backdrop designed for an elegant wedding celebration.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Fresh floral styling\n* Premium backdrop design\n* Customizable color theme\n* Elegant stage seating\n* Professional setup\n\nDo NOT show:\n\n* Price\n* Add to cart\n* Buy now\n\nInstead show:\n\n**View Details**\n\nand optionally:\n\n**WhatsApp Enquiry**\n\n---\n\n# 8. Product Card Design\n\nCards should be highly visual.\n\nInclude:\n\n* Large image\n* Product name\n* Category\n* Short description\n* 3\342\200\2235 key features\n* View Details button\n* WhatsApp button/icon\n\nAdd subtle Framer Motion interactions:\n\n* Image scale on hover\n* Card elevation\n* Button animation\n* Smooth reveal\n\nAvoid excessive hover effects on mobile.\n\n---\n\n# 9. Product Details Page\n\nWhen a user clicks a decoration, open a dedicated product details page.\n\nExample URL:\n\n`/decorations/royal-bloom-wedding-stage`\n\nThe page should contain:\n\n### Image Gallery\n\nSupport **multiple images per decoration**.\n\nFor example:\n\n* Main stage image\n* Front view\n* Side view\n* Close-up decoration\n* Night lighting\n* Seating arrangement\n* Full venue view\n\nCreate a premium gallery.\n\nDesktop:\n\nLarge main image + thumbnail navigation.\n\nMobile:\n\nApp-like swipeable image gallery.\n\nUse smooth transitions.\n\n---\n\n# 10. Product Details Content\n\nShow:\n\n### Decoration Name\n\nExample:\n\n**Royal Bloom Wedding Stage**\n\n### Category\n\nWedding Stage\n\n### Description\n\nProvide an attractive, customer-friendly description.\n\n### Features\n\nUse visual feature cards/icons.\n\nExample:\n\n* \360\237\214\270 Premium floral arrangement\n* \342\234\250 Elegant lighting setup\n* \360\237\216\250 Customizable color palette\n* \360\237\252\221 Premium stage seating\n* \360\237\223\270 Photo-friendly backdrop\n* \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Professional setup & installation\n\nDo not make the features generic.\n\nFeatures should actually describe the decoration.\n\n---\n\n# 11. WhatsApp Enquiry\n\nThe main conversion action should be WhatsApp.\n\nEvery decoration should have a:\n\n**\342\200\234Enquire on WhatsApp\342\200\235**\n\nbutton.\n\nWhen clicked, redirect to WhatsApp with a pre-filled message containing:\n\n* Decoration/product name\n* Company name\n* Customer enquiry intent\n\nExample message:\n\n> Hello Event Perambra,\n> I\'m interested in the \342\200\234Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\342\200\235.\n> Could you please share more details about this decoration?\n\nUse a configurable WhatsApp phone number in the project configuration.\n\nDo not hardcode the number in multiple components.\n\nCreate something like:\n\n```js\nconst COMPANY_CONFIG = {\n  name: \"Event Perambra\",\n  whatsappNumber: \"YOUR_WHATSAPP_NUMBER\"\n}\n```\n\nThe WhatsApp URL should be dynamically generated.\n\n---\n\n# 12. No Pricing\n\nThis is NOT a traditional e-commerce website.\n\nNever display:\n\n* \342\202\2710\n* Starting from \342\202\271...\n* Price on request\n* Discount\n* Sale\n* Cart\n* Checkout\n\nThe website should focus entirely on:\n\n**Inspiration \342\206\222 Details \342\206\222 WhatsApp Enquiry**\n\n---\n\n# 13. Mobile Experience\n\nMobile is extremely important.\n\nThe mobile version should feel almost like a **modern mobile app**, not a desktop website squeezed onto a phone.\n\nImplement:\n\n* Sticky mobile header\n* Large touch-friendly buttons\n* Horizontal category scrolling\n* Swipe-friendly galleries\n* Bottom/floating WhatsApp CTA\n* Comfortable spacing\n* Large product photography\n* Easy thumb navigation\n* Smooth page transitions\n* Mobile-friendly filters\n* No tiny text\n* No cramped cards\n\nProduct cards on mobile should be visually rich and easy to browse.\n\nConsider a layout such as:\n\n**One large card per row**\n\nrather than trying to fit many small cards.\n\n---\n\n# 14. Desktop Experience\n\nDesktop should use the available screen space elegantly.\n\nDecoration collection:\n\n* 3-column or 4-column grid depending on screen size\n* Large photography\n* Consistent card proportions\n* Spacious layout\n\nProduct details:\n\n* Large gallery on the left\n* Information panel on the right\n* Sticky enquiry CTA where appropriate\n\nUse responsive breakpoints intelligently.\n\n---\n\n# 15. Navigation\n\nDesktop navigation:\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n* Home\n* Decorations\n* Categories\n* About\n* Contact\n\nCTA:\n\n**WhatsApp Us**\n\nMobile navigation should be simpler.\n\nUse a clean mobile header with:\n\n* Logo/name\n* Menu icon\n* WhatsApp icon\n\nOptionally use a mobile bottom navigation:\n\n**Home | Explore | Categories | Contact**\n\nKeep it minimal and elegant.\n\n---\n\n# 16. Search & Filtering\n\nAdd a useful decoration browsing experience.\n\nAllow customers to filter by:\n\n* Event type\n* Decoration style\n* Color/theme\n* Category\n\nExample:\n\n**Wedding \342\206\222 Modern \342\206\222 Floral**\n\nAdd search functionality:\n\n> \342\200\234Search decorations\342\200\246\342\200\235\n\nMake filters easy to use on mobile.\n\nDo not make the filtering system overly complicated.\n\n---\n\n# 17. Featured Decorations\n\nCreate a section such as:\n\n### \342\200\234Made For Your Moment\342\200\235\n\nShow selected premium decorations.\n\nAnother section:\n\n### \342\200\234Most Loved Designs\342\200\235\n\nShow popular decorations.\n\nAnother:\n\n### \342\200\234Find Your Style\342\200\235\n\nShow:\n\n* Classic\n* Modern\n* Minimal\n* Floral\n* Traditional\n* Luxury\n\nThese should feel editorial and inspirational rather than like a generic product grid.\n\n---\n\n# 18. About Event Perambra\n\nCreate a short brand section explaining the company.\n\nExample concept:\n\n> **\342\200\234We don\'t just decorate stages. We create the backdrop to your memories.\342\200\235**\n\nExplain that Event Perambra creates customized event environments with attention to:\n\n* Design\n* Details\n* Quality\n* Customer preferences\n* Event atmosphere\n\nUse photography rather than excessive text.\n\n---\n\n# 19. Gallery / Inspiration\n\nCreate an image-focused gallery.\n\nTitle:\n\n### **\342\200\234Moments We\'ve Helped Make Beautiful\342\200\235**\n\nDisplay event decoration photographs in a masonry/editorial layout.\n\nClicking an image can open a lightbox.\n\nUse Framer Motion for smooth image reveal.\n\n---\n\n# 20. Testimonials\n\nAdd a small customer testimonial section.\n\nExample:\n\n> \342\200\234The stage looked even more beautiful than we imagined. Every detail was perfect.\342\200\235\n\nShow:\n\n* Customer name\n* Event type\n* Short review\n\nKeep it elegant and believable.\n\nDo not create hundreds of fake testimonials.\n\nUse a small number of sample data entries that can easily be replaced later.\n\n---\n\n# 21. Contact Section\n\nCreate a strong CTA near the bottom:\n\n### **Planning Your Special Day?**\n\n> **\342\200\234Tell us what you\'re imagining. We\'ll help turn it into a beautiful setting.\342\200\235**\n\nButtons:\n\n**WhatsApp Us**\n\n**Explore Decorations**\n\nInclude basic contact information and social media placeholders.\n\n---\n\n# 22. Footer\n\nElegant minimal footer.\n\nInclude:\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n> Creating beautiful spaces for unforgettable moments.\n\nLinks:\n\n* Home\n* Decorations\n* About\n* Contact\n* WhatsApp\n\nCopyright:\n\n**\302\251 Event Perambra. All rights reserved.**\n\n---\n\n# 23. Data Architecture\n\nDo NOT hardcode decoration information directly inside UI components.\n\nCreate structured data.\n\nExample:\n\n```js\nconst decorations = [\n  {\n    id: \"royal-bloom-wedding-stage\",\n    name: \"Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\",\n    category: \"Wedding\",\n    style: \"Luxury\",\n    description: \"...\",\n    features: [\n      \"Premium floral arrangement\",\n      \"Elegant backdrop\",\n      \"Customizable color theme\",\n      \"Professional lighting\",\n      \"Premium stage seating\"\n    ],\n    images: [\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-1.jpg\",\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-2.jpg\",\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-3.jpg\"\n    ],\n    featured: true\n  }\n];\n```\n\nThis should make it easy to add 50+ decorations later without changing components.\n\n---\n\n# 24. Component Architecture\n\nUse reusable components such as:\n\n```text\nsrc/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Header.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 MobileNavigation.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Hero.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CategoryScroller.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationCard.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationGrid.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationGallery.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 FeatureList.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WhatsAppButton.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Testimonials.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 InspirationGallery.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Footer.jsx\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Home.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Decorations.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationDetails.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 About.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Contact.jsx\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 decorations.js\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 company.js\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.jsx\n```\n\nKeep components clean and reusable.\n\n---\n\n# 25. Framer Motion\n\nUse Framer Motion throughout the site, but keep animations premium and subtle.\n\nImplement:\n\n* Page transitions\n* Scroll reveal\n* Fade + slide animations\n* Image reveal\n* Card hover effects\n* Button interactions\n* Gallery transitions\n* Mobile menu animation\n* Modal/lightbox animations\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Excessive bouncing\n* Constant movement\n* Distracting animations\n* Long animation delays\n\nThe website should feel **smooth, expensive and polished**.\n\n---\n\n# 26. Responsive Requirements\n\nTest carefully at:\n\n* 320px\n* 375px\n* 390px\n* 414px\n* 768px\n* 1024px\n* 1280px\n* 1440px+\n\nThere must be:\n\n* No horizontal overflow\n* No broken images\n* No overlapping text\n* No clipped buttons\n* No unusable navigation\n* No desktop layout forced onto mobile\n\n---\n\n# 27. Performance\n\nOptimize for fast loading.\n\nUse:\n\n* Lazy-loaded images\n* Responsive image sizes\n* Proper image aspect ratios\n* Minimal unnecessary dependencies\n* Code splitting where appropriate\n* Semantic HTML\n* Good Lighthouse performance\n\nDo not load huge images unnecessarily.\n\n---\n\n# 28. UX Principle\n\nThe entire website should follow this customer journey:\n\n**Discover \342\206\222 Get Inspired \342\206\222 Explore \342\206\222 View Details \342\206\222 Enquire**\n\nThe user should never feel like they are shopping for a physical product.\n\nThey should feel like they are **choosing the perfect look for their event**.\n\n---\n\n# 29. Important Design Requirement\n\nDo NOT produce a generic AI-generated website.\n\nAvoid the typical:\n\n> Hero + 3 cards + About + Testimonials + Footer\n\ntemplate structure unless each section has a strong visual purpose.\n\nThe design should have:\n\n* Editorial-style image layouts\n* Strong visual storytelling\n* Beautiful typography\n* Interesting section transitions\n* Different card compositions\n* Premium photography presentation\n* Customer-focused copy\n* Mobile-first interaction patterns\n\nMake it feel like a **real Kerala event decoration brand**, not a fictional SaaS startup.\n\n---\n\n# 30. Final Quality Standard\n\nBefore completing the implementation, check:\n\n### Design\n\n* Premium\n* Elegant\n* Simple\n* Modern\n* Visually rich\n\n### UX\n\n* Easy to browse\n* Easy to find decorations\n* Easy to view multiple photos\n* Easy to contact through WhatsApp\n\n### Mobile\n\n* App-like\n* Touch-friendly\n* Fast\n* Beautiful\n* Fully responsive\n\n### Technical\n\n* React.js\n* Tailwind CSS\n* Framer Motion\n* Reusable components\n* Structured product data\n* React Router\n* Maintainable architecture\n\n### Business\n\n* No product prices\n* No cart\n* No checkout\n* WhatsApp is the primary conversion\n* Product-specific WhatsApp messages\n* Multiple product images\n* Detailed product features\n\nBuild the complete frontend with realistic sample decoration data and placeholder images that can easily be replaced with actual Event Perambra photographs later.\n\nThe final result should look like a **premium event decoration portfolio + product discovery platform**, with a strong emphasis on **beautiful visuals and WhatsApp enquiries**.\n"
    items {
      text: "# Build a Modern Event Decoration Product Showcase Website\n\nCreate a **production-quality, fully responsive product listing website** for an event management and stage decoration company called **\342\200\234Event Perambra\342\200\235**.\n\nThe website should showcase event decoration packages and services as **visual products**, but **do not display prices**. The primary goal is to inspire customers, help them explore decoration options, view detailed photos/features, and contact the company directly through WhatsApp.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Technology Stack\n\nUse:\n\n* **React.js**\n* **Tailwind CSS**\n* **Framer Motion** for animations\n* React Router for navigation\n* Modern component-based architecture\n* Responsive design for mobile, tablet, and desktop\n* Clean, reusable components\n* Optimized image loading\n* Semantic HTML and good accessibility practices\n\nDo NOT create a generic template-looking website.\n\nThe design should feel like a **real premium event decoration brand website**.\n\n---\n\n# 2. Brand\n\n### Company Name\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n### Business Type\n\nEvent management and stage decoration company.\n\nThe website primarily showcases:\n\n* Wedding stage decorations\n* Engagement decorations\n* Birthday decorations\n* Reception decorations\n* Haldi decorations\n* Mehndi decorations\n* Anniversary decorations\n* Baby shower decorations\n* Traditional Kerala-style decorations\n* Modern stage setups\n* Floral decorations\n* Backdrop decorations\n* Entrance decorations\n* Customized event setups\n\nUse realistic product/service terminology rather than generic e-commerce terminology wherever appropriate.\n\nFor example, instead of:\n\n> \342\200\234Product 01\342\200\235\n\nUse attractive names such as:\n\n> **Royal Floral Wedding Stage**\n\n> **Elegant Ivory Reception Setup**\n\n> **Dream Garden Engagement Stage**\n\n> **Kerala Heritage Wedding Decor**\n\n> **Luxury Golden Glow Stage**\n\n---\n\n# 3. Overall Design Direction\n\nCreate a **simple, elegant, premium and visually attractive UI**.\n\nThe website should feel like a combination of:\n\n* Premium event portfolio\n* Modern product catalog\n* Wedding inspiration platform\n* Mobile-first business website\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Overly complicated layouts\n* Excessive gradients\n* Cheap-looking colors\n* Generic dashboard-style UI\n* Generic SaaS templates\n* Excessive animations\n* Huge blocks of text\n* Price-focused e-commerce design\n\nThe **photography should be the main focus**.\n\nUse generous whitespace, elegant typography, rounded cards, subtle shadows, beautiful image layouts and refined animations.\n\nSuggested visual direction:\n\n* Warm neutral background\n* White / off-white surfaces\n* Elegant dark typography\n* Subtle gold/beige accent\n* Large high-quality event photography\n* Soft rounded corners\n* Minimal borders\n* Premium editorial-style layouts\n\nDo not overuse gold. Keep the design sophisticated.\n\n---\n\n# 4. Home Page\n\nCreate a visually strong homepage.\n\n## Hero Section\n\nLarge, immersive event decoration image/video background.\n\nHeadline should be emotionally appealing and customer-focused.\n\nExample:\n\n> **\342\200\234Turning Your Special Moments Into Beautiful Memories.\342\200\235**\n\nSupporting text:\n\n> **\342\200\234Elegant stage decorations and unforgettable event setups, thoughtfully designed for your special day.\342\200\235**\n\nPrimary CTA:\n\n**Explore Decorations**\n\nSecondary CTA:\n\n**Chat on WhatsApp**\n\nInclude a subtle animated scroll indicator.\n\nUse Framer Motion for:\n\n* Text entrance\n* Image reveal\n* CTA animation\n* Subtle floating effects\n\nDo not make animations distracting.\n\n---\n\n# 5. Customer-Centric Copy\n\nUse attractive words that appeal to customers.\n\nAvoid boring generic copy such as:\n\n> \342\200\234We provide event management services.\342\200\235\n\nInstead use messaging like:\n\n> **\342\200\234Your dream celebration deserves a beautiful stage.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234Designed around your moment. Decorated around your vision.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234From intimate celebrations to grand weddings, we create spaces worth remembering.\342\200\235**\n\n> **\342\200\234Choose your style. Share your vision. Let us create the setting.\342\200\235**\n\nThe copy should communicate:\n\n* Emotion\n* Elegance\n* Trust\n* Creativity\n* Customization\n* Memorable experiences\n\n---\n\n# 6. Decoration Categories\n\nCreate a beautiful category navigation section.\n\nCategories could include:\n\n* Weddings\n* Engagements\n* Birthdays\n* Receptions\n* Haldi\n* Mehndi\n* Baby Shower\n* Traditional\n* Modern\n* Floral\n* Custom Designs\n\nEach category should have an attractive image and subtle hover animation.\n\nOn mobile, categories should work like a horizontally scrollable app-style category selector.\n\n---\n\n# 7. Product / Decoration Listing\n\nCreate the main **Decoration Collection** section.\n\nEach decoration should be presented as a product-style card.\n\nExample card:\n\n### Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\n\nLarge image.\n\nSmall category label:\n\n**Wedding Stage**\n\nShort description:\n\n> A luxurious floral backdrop designed for an elegant wedding celebration.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Fresh floral styling\n* Premium backdrop design\n* Customizable color theme\n* Elegant stage seating\n* Professional setup\n\nDo NOT show:\n\n* Price\n* Add to cart\n* Buy now\n\nInstead show:\n\n**View Details**\n\nand optionally:\n\n**WhatsApp Enquiry**\n\n---\n\n# 8. Product Card Design\n\nCards should be highly visual.\n\nInclude:\n\n* Large image\n* Product name\n* Category\n* Short description\n* 3\342\200\2235 key features\n* View Details button\n* WhatsApp button/icon\n\nAdd subtle Framer Motion interactions:\n\n* Image scale on hover\n* Card elevation\n* Button animation\n* Smooth reveal\n\nAvoid excessive hover effects on mobile.\n\n---\n\n# 9. Product Details Page\n\nWhen a user clicks a decoration, open a dedicated product details page.\n\nExample URL:\n\n`/decorations/royal-bloom-wedding-stage`\n\nThe page should contain:\n\n### Image Gallery\n\nSupport **multiple images per decoration**.\n\nFor example:\n\n* Main stage image\n* Front view\n* Side view\n* Close-up decoration\n* Night lighting\n* Seating arrangement\n* Full venue view\n\nCreate a premium gallery.\n\nDesktop:\n\nLarge main image + thumbnail navigation.\n\nMobile:\n\nApp-like swipeable image gallery.\n\nUse smooth transitions.\n\n---\n\n# 10. Product Details Content\n\nShow:\n\n### Decoration Name\n\nExample:\n\n**Royal Bloom Wedding Stage**\n\n### Category\n\nWedding Stage\n\n### Description\n\nProvide an attractive, customer-friendly description.\n\n### Features\n\nUse visual feature cards/icons.\n\nExample:\n\n* \360\237\214\270 Premium floral arrangement\n* \342\234\250 Elegant lighting setup\n* \360\237\216\250 Customizable color palette\n* \360\237\252\221 Premium stage seating\n* \360\237\223\270 Photo-friendly backdrop\n* \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Professional setup & installation\n\nDo not make the features generic.\n\nFeatures should actually describe the decoration.\n\n---\n\n# 11. WhatsApp Enquiry\n\nThe main conversion action should be WhatsApp.\n\nEvery decoration should have a:\n\n**\342\200\234Enquire on WhatsApp\342\200\235**\n\nbutton.\n\nWhen clicked, redirect to WhatsApp with a pre-filled message containing:\n\n* Decoration/product name\n* Company name\n* Customer enquiry intent\n\nExample message:\n\n> Hello Event Perambra,\n> I\'m interested in the \342\200\234Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\342\200\235.\n> Could you please share more details about this decoration?\n\nUse a configurable WhatsApp phone number in the project configuration.\n\nDo not hardcode the number in multiple components.\n\nCreate something like:\n\n```js\nconst COMPANY_CONFIG = {\n  name: \"Event Perambra\",\n  whatsappNumber: \"YOUR_WHATSAPP_NUMBER\"\n}\n```\n\nThe WhatsApp URL should be dynamically generated.\n\n---\n\n# 12. No Pricing\n\nThis is NOT a traditional e-commerce website.\n\nNever display:\n\n* \342\202\2710\n* Starting from \342\202\271...\n* Price on request\n* Discount\n* Sale\n* Cart\n* Checkout\n\nThe website should focus entirely on:\n\n**Inspiration \342\206\222 Details \342\206\222 WhatsApp Enquiry**\n\n---\n\n# 13. Mobile Experience\n\nMobile is extremely important.\n\nThe mobile version should feel almost like a **modern mobile app**, not a desktop website squeezed onto a phone.\n\nImplement:\n\n* Sticky mobile header\n* Large touch-friendly buttons\n* Horizontal category scrolling\n* Swipe-friendly galleries\n* Bottom/floating WhatsApp CTA\n* Comfortable spacing\n* Large product photography\n* Easy thumb navigation\n* Smooth page transitions\n* Mobile-friendly filters\n* No tiny text\n* No cramped cards\n\nProduct cards on mobile should be visually rich and easy to browse.\n\nConsider a layout such as:\n\n**One large card per row**\n\nrather than trying to fit many small cards.\n\n---\n\n# 14. Desktop Experience\n\nDesktop should use the available screen space elegantly.\n\nDecoration collection:\n\n* 3-column or 4-column grid depending on screen size\n* Large photography\n* Consistent card proportions\n* Spacious layout\n\nProduct details:\n\n* Large gallery on the left\n* Information panel on the right\n* Sticky enquiry CTA where appropriate\n\nUse responsive breakpoints intelligently.\n\n---\n\n# 15. Navigation\n\nDesktop navigation:\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n* Home\n* Decorations\n* Categories\n* About\n* Contact\n\nCTA:\n\n**WhatsApp Us**\n\nMobile navigation should be simpler.\n\nUse a clean mobile header with:\n\n* Logo/name\n* Menu icon\n* WhatsApp icon\n\nOptionally use a mobile bottom navigation:\n\n**Home | Explore | Categories | Contact**\n\nKeep it minimal and elegant.\n\n---\n\n# 16. Search & Filtering\n\nAdd a useful decoration browsing experience.\n\nAllow customers to filter by:\n\n* Event type\n* Decoration style\n* Color/theme\n* Category\n\nExample:\n\n**Wedding \342\206\222 Modern \342\206\222 Floral**\n\nAdd search functionality:\n\n> \342\200\234Search decorations\342\200\246\342\200\235\n\nMake filters easy to use on mobile.\n\nDo not make the filtering system overly complicated.\n\n---\n\n# 17. Featured Decorations\n\nCreate a section such as:\n\n### \342\200\234Made For Your Moment\342\200\235\n\nShow selected premium decorations.\n\nAnother section:\n\n### \342\200\234Most Loved Designs\342\200\235\n\nShow popular decorations.\n\nAnother:\n\n### \342\200\234Find Your Style\342\200\235\n\nShow:\n\n* Classic\n* Modern\n* Minimal\n* Floral\n* Traditional\n* Luxury\n\nThese should feel editorial and inspirational rather than like a generic product grid.\n\n---\n\n# 18. About Event Perambra\n\nCreate a short brand section explaining the company.\n\nExample concept:\n\n> **\342\200\234We don\'t just decorate stages. We create the backdrop to your memories.\342\200\235**\n\nExplain that Event Perambra creates customized event environments with attention to:\n\n* Design\n* Details\n* Quality\n* Customer preferences\n* Event atmosphere\n\nUse photography rather than excessive text.\n\n---\n\n# 19. Gallery / Inspiration\n\nCreate an image-focused gallery.\n\nTitle:\n\n### **\342\200\234Moments We\'ve Helped Make Beautiful\342\200\235**\n\nDisplay event decoration photographs in a masonry/editorial layout.\n\nClicking an image can open a lightbox.\n\nUse Framer Motion for smooth image reveal.\n\n---\n\n# 20. Testimonials\n\nAdd a small customer testimonial section.\n\nExample:\n\n> \342\200\234The stage looked even more beautiful than we imagined. Every detail was perfect.\342\200\235\n\nShow:\n\n* Customer name\n* Event type\n* Short review\n\nKeep it elegant and believable.\n\nDo not create hundreds of fake testimonials.\n\nUse a small number of sample data entries that can easily be replaced later.\n\n---\n\n# 21. Contact Section\n\nCreate a strong CTA near the bottom:\n\n### **Planning Your Special Day?**\n\n> **\342\200\234Tell us what you\'re imagining. We\'ll help turn it into a beautiful setting.\342\200\235**\n\nButtons:\n\n**WhatsApp Us**\n\n**Explore Decorations**\n\nInclude basic contact information and social media placeholders.\n\n---\n\n# 22. Footer\n\nElegant minimal footer.\n\nInclude:\n\n**Event Perambra**\n\n> Creating beautiful spaces for unforgettable moments.\n\nLinks:\n\n* Home\n* Decorations\n* About\n* Contact\n* WhatsApp\n\nCopyright:\n\n**\302\251 Event Perambra. All rights reserved.**\n\n---\n\n# 23. Data Architecture\n\nDo NOT hardcode decoration information directly inside UI components.\n\nCreate structured data.\n\nExample:\n\n```js\nconst decorations = [\n  {\n    id: \"royal-bloom-wedding-stage\",\n    name: \"Royal Bloom Wedding Stage\",\n    category: \"Wedding\",\n    style: \"Luxury\",\n    description: \"...\",\n    features: [\n      \"Premium floral arrangement\",\n      \"Elegant backdrop\",\n      \"Customizable color theme\",\n      \"Professional lighting\",\n      \"Premium stage seating\"\n    ],\n    images: [\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-1.jpg\",\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-2.jpg\",\n      \"/images/decorations/royal-bloom-3.jpg\"\n    ],\n    featured: true\n  }\n];\n```\n\nThis should make it easy to add 50+ decorations later without changing components.\n\n---\n\n# 24. Component Architecture\n\nUse reusable components such as:\n\n```text\nsrc/\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Header.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 MobileNavigation.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Hero.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 CategoryScroller.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationCard.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationGrid.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationGallery.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 FeatureList.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WhatsAppButton.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Testimonials.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 InspirationGallery.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Footer.jsx\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Home.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Decorations.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 DecorationDetails.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 About.jsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Contact.jsx\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 decorations.js\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 company.js\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.jsx\n```\n\nKeep components clean and reusable.\n\n---\n\n# 25. Framer Motion\n\nUse Framer Motion throughout the site, but keep animations premium and subtle.\n\nImplement:\n\n* Page transitions\n* Scroll reveal\n* Fade + slide animations\n* Image reveal\n* Card hover effects\n* Button interactions\n* Gallery transitions\n* Mobile menu animation\n* Modal/lightbox animations\n\nAvoid:\n\n* Excessive bouncing\n* Constant movement\n* Distracting animations\n* Long animation delays\n\nThe website should feel **smooth, expensive and polished**.\n\n---\n\n# 26. Responsive Requirements\n\nTest carefully at:\n\n* 320px\n* 375px\n* 390px\n* 414px\n* 768px\n* 1024px\n* 1280px\n* 1440px+\n\nThere must be:\n\n* No horizontal overflow\n* No broken images\n* No overlapping text\n* No clipped buttons\n* No unusable navigation\n* No desktop layout forced onto mobile\n\n---\n\n# 27. Performance\n\nOptimize for fast loading.\n\nUse:\n\n* Lazy-loaded images\n* Responsive image sizes\n* Proper image aspect ratios\n* Minimal unnecessary dependencies\n* Code splitting where appropriate\n* Semantic HTML\n* Good Lighthouse performance\n\nDo not load huge images unnecessarily.\n\n---\n\n# 28. UX Principle\n\nThe entire website should follow this customer journey:\n\n**Discover \342\206\222 Get Inspired \342\206\222 Explore \342\206\222 View Details \342\206\222 Enquire**\n\nThe user should never feel like they are shopping for a physical product.\n\nThey should feel like they are **choosing the perfect look for their event**.\n\n---\n\n# 29. Important Design Requirement\n\nDo NOT produce a generic AI-generated website.\n\nAvoid the typical:\n\n> Hero + 3 cards + About + Testimonials + Footer\n\ntemplate structure unless each section has a strong visual purpose.\n\nThe design should have:\n\n* Editorial-style image layouts\n* Strong visual storytelling\n* Beautiful typography\n* Interesting section transitions\n* Different card compositions\n* Premium photography presentation\n* Customer-focused copy\n* Mobile-first interaction patterns\n\nMake it feel like a **real Kerala event decoration brand**, not a fictional SaaS startup.\n\n---\n\n# 30. Final Quality Standard\n\nBefore completing the implementation, check:\n\n### Design\n\n* Premium\n* Elegant\n* Simple\n* Modern\n* Visually rich\n\n### UX\n\n* Easy to browse\n* Easy to find decorations\n* Easy to view multiple photos\n* Easy to contact through WhatsApp\n\n### Mobile\n\n* App-like\n* Touch-friendly\n* Fast\n* Beautiful\n* Fully responsive\n\n### Technical\n\n* React.js\n* Tailwind CSS\n* Framer Motion\n* Reusable components\n* Structured product data\n* React Router\n* Maintainable architecture\n\n### Business\n\n* No product prices\n* No cart\n* No checkout\n* WhatsApp is the primary conversion\n* Product-specific WhatsApp messages\n* Multiple product images\n* Detailed product features\n\nBuild the complete frontend with realistic sample decoration data and placeholder images that can easily be replaced with actual Event Perambra photographs later.\n\nThe final result should look like a **premium event decoration portfolio + product discovery platform**, with a strong emphasis on **beautiful visuals and WhatsApp enquiries**.\n"
    }
  }
}
