  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Project Structure**\n\nOkay, I\'m defining the project structure now. I\'ve decided on the files we need. I have `src/config/company.ts` for company information and links, and `src/types/decoration.ts` for interfaces like Decoration, Category, Review, and InspirationItem. I\'m building out from there.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Architecture**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the data architecture, focusing on key data files. I\'m populating `data/decorations.ts` with diverse, detailed decoration packages and high-quality photography, spanning various event types. I am also working on `src/data/categories.ts`, `src/data/testimonials.ts`, and `src/data/inspirations.ts`. Furthermore, I\'ve created  `src/context/SavedDecorationsContext.tsx` for wishlist functionality and `src/components/Header.tsx` for navigation and a WhatsApp CTA.\n\n\n**Developing UI Components**\n\nNow I\'m developing the UI components. I\'ve designed `MobileNavigation.tsx` for easy mobile navigation. Also, I created `FloatingWhatsApp.tsx` to facilitate enquiries. I built an appealing `Hero.tsx` with high-impact imagery. I created `CategoryScroller.tsx` for easy browsing, and `DecorationCard.tsx` as a product card. I am working on `DecorationGrid.tsx`, `FilterBar.tsx`, `FeatureList.tsx` and `Testimonials.tsx` as well.\n\n\n**Constructing Key Pages**\n\nI\'m now constructing the key pages of the site. I\'ve built `src/components/InspirationGallery.tsx`, a masonry gallery with a lightbox. I have completed `src/components/Footer.tsx` with a brand statement and quick links. I also created `src/components/SavedModal.tsx` as a wishlist modal. Furthermore, I\'ve designed the homepage, `src/pages/Home.tsx`, and begun work on the full catalog page, `src/pages/Decorations.tsx`, including search and category tabs.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 707017573
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
