        lines {
          text: "    fullDescription: \"Rooted deeply in God\'s Own Country\'s cultural heritage, this setup celebrates Kerala\'s timeless matrimonial elegance. Crafted with authentic teakwood carved pillars, golden marigold drapery, fragrant Madurai jasmine cascades, and radiant multi-tiered brass Nilavilakkus. Perfectly balanced with tender coconut hangings, fresh banana leaf motifs, and customary wooden charupadi accents.\","
