        lines {
          text: "    fullDescription: \"The entrance is the first promise of the celebration within. This grand traditional gateway incorporates authentic Kerala Padippura architecture, clay tile gables, tall brass deepams, tender coconut (karikku) clusters, and live floral arches of fresh marigold and jasmine. Guests step through an aromatic threshold that evokes the splendor of an ancient Kerala palace.\","
