        lines {
          text: "    fullDescription: \"Inspired by clear Kerala night skies, this stage transports guests into an ethereal starlit dream. A seamless midnight-blue seamless backdrop is embedded with twinkling fiber-optic starlight points. Pure white phalaenopsis orchids and floating glass orbs with tea lights flank the stage, creating a deeply romantic and sophisticated atmosphere for evening dinners and receptions.\","
