        lines {
          text: "    fullDescription: \"Embrace the effortless grace of earthy bohemian styling. Natural fluffy pampas grass plumes, bleached ruscus, terracotta pottery, and natural timber arches create an organic and relaxed aesthetic. Completed with hand-knotted macrame backdrops, rattan peacock chairs, and soft amber uplighting that mimics a golden hour sunset.\","
