          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "    fullDescription: \"Built specifically for Hindu marriage ceremonies across Malabar and Kerala temples. This four-pillared mandapam is draped entirely with thousands of fragrant white jasmine (mulla) strings and sacred golden champaka flowers. The mandap platform accommodates the sacred homam fire pit, brass paras, and family seating with complete architectural safety and traditional decorum.\","
