  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and built the modern event decoration showcase website for **Event Perambra**.\n\n### Visual Identity & Craftsmanship\n- **Warm Neutral & Editorial Palette**: Framed with a serene off-white canvas (`#FAF8F5`), charcoal typography, and subtle champagne/gold accents (`#C5A880`).\n- **Typographic Pairing**: Paired Cormorant Garamond for elegant editorial headings with Plus Jakarta Sans for body legibility and crisp mobile readability.\n- **Strict No-Pricing Architecture**: Eliminated all pricing, cart, and checkout references to keep the focus entirely on visual discovery, inspiration, and personal consultation.\n\n### Key Functional Highlights\n- **Immersive Hero Experience**: Emotionally resonant headline, *\"Turning Your Special Moments Into Beautiful Memories\"*, paired with high-impact stage imagery, dual CTAs (*Explore Decorations* & *Chat on WhatsApp*), and a heritage stats counter.\n- **Horizontally Scrollable Category Scroller**: App-style swipeable category cards on mobile and desktop arrow navigation for weddings, traditional Kerala mandaps, evening receptions, haldi ceremonies, and boho floral setups.\n- **Visual Product Card Architecture**: Each stage setting features high-resolution photography, category tags, color palette chips, key feature bullets, a direct *View Details* action, and an instant WhatsApp enquiry trigger.\n- **Dedicated Product Details View (`/decorations/:id`)**:\n  - Multi-image desktop thumbnail gallery and mobile swipe view with a fullscreen zoom lightbox.\n  - Icon-driven feature cards highlighting fresh flower sourcing, structural safety, and custom ambient lighting.\n  - Technical specifications grid displaying backdrop dimensions, setup duration, floral composition, and stage seating.\n  - Single-tap *Enquire on WhatsApp* button generating prefilled messages tailored specifically to that decoration.\n  - Related decoration recommendations and share functionality.\n- **Interactive Shortlist (Saved Inspirations)**: Prospective couples can tap the heart icon on any stage card to compile a personal moodboard and send their entire shortlist directly to Event Perambra via WhatsApp in one tap.\n- **Editorial Brand Story & Inspiration Gallery**: Brand narrative highlighting Kerala heritage, floral sourcing, and a masonry inspiration gallery with interactive photo expansion (*\"Moments We\'ve Helped Make Beautiful\"*).\n- **Direct WhatsApp Consultation Planner**: The Contact page includes an interactive inquiry builder where clients select their event date, venue town, and celebration type to immediately initiate a formatted consultation in WhatsApp.\n- **Mobile-First App Bar & Floating Actions**: Includes a sticky bottom navigation bar and a floating WhatsApp action pill designed for single-hand mobile browsing."
    thinking: "**Verifying Build Success**\n\nThe build completed without issues! I\'m now diving into a thorough review of the original prompt to meticulously verify that every requirement, particularly the \"Event Perambra\" brand and its realistic representation as an event management and stage decoration company, is fully satisfied.\n\n\n**Defining Design Principles**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got a much clearer picture now. I am focusing intensely on the design principles. The emphasis is on warm neutrals and high-quality photography as well as a defined editorial layout. I\'m carefully considering how to represent the brand visually, adhering to specifications like the colors and fonts (Cormorant Garamond and Plus Jakarta Sans). I\'m also fleshing out the home page elements, including the hero section, the category scroller, and the \"Find Your Style\" section, making sure to capture their essence.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and built the modern event decoration showcase website for **Event Perambra**.\n\n### Visual Identity & Craftsmanship\n- **Warm Neutral & Editorial Palette**: Framed with a serene off-white canvas (`#FAF8F5`), charcoal typography, and subtle champagne/gold accents (`#C5A880`).\n- **Typographic Pairing**: Paired Cormorant Garamond for elegant editorial headings with Plus Jakarta Sans for body legibility and crisp mobile readability.\n- **Strict No-Pricing Architecture**: Eliminated all pricing, cart, and checkout references to keep the focus entirely on visual discovery, inspiration, and personal consultation.\n\n### Key Functional Highlights\n- **Immersive Hero Experience**: Emotionally resonant headline, *\"Turning Your Special Moments Into Beautiful Memories\"*, paired with high-impact stage imagery, dual CTAs (*Explore Decorations* & *Chat on WhatsApp*), and a heritage stats counter.\n- **Horizontally Scrollable Category Scroller**: App-style swipeable category cards on mobile and desktop arrow navigation for weddings, traditional Kerala mandaps, evening receptions, haldi ceremonies, and boho floral setups.\n- **Visual Product Card Architecture**: Each stage setting features high-resolution photography, category tags, color palette chips, key feature bullets, a direct *View Details* action, and an instant WhatsApp enquiry trigger.\n- **Dedicated Product Details View (`/decorations/:id`)**:\n  - Multi-image desktop thumbnail gallery and mobile swipe view with a fullscreen zoom lightbox.\n  - Icon-driven feature cards highlighting fresh flower sourcing, structural safety, and custom ambient lighting.\n  - Technical specifications grid displaying backdrop dimensions, setup duration, floral composition, and stage seating.\n  - Single-tap *Enquire on WhatsApp* button generating prefilled messages tailored specifically to that decoration.\n  - Related decoration recommendations and share functionality.\n- **Interactive Shortlist (Saved Inspirations)**: Prospective couples can tap the heart icon on any stage card to compile a personal moodboard and send their entire shortlist directly to Event Perambra via WhatsApp in one tap.\n- **Editorial Brand Story & Inspiration Gallery**: Brand narrative highlighting Kerala heritage, floral sourcing, and a masonry inspiration gallery with interactive photo expansion (*\"Moments We\'ve Helped Make Beautiful\"*).\n- **Direct WhatsApp Consultation Planner**: The Contact page includes an interactive inquiry builder where clients select their event date, venue town, and celebration type to immediately initiate a formatted consultation in WhatsApp.\n- **Mobile-First App Bar & Floating Actions**: Includes a sticky bottom navigation bar and a floating WhatsApp action pill designed for single-hand mobile browsing."
